<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT--Sun Co raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT--Sun Co raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co raised its rating on Sun Co to accumulate from hold following better than expected first quarter results.</p>
<p>-- raised earnings estimates for fiscal 1997 to $1.95 a share from $1.30 a share and for fiscal 1998 to $2.50 a share from $1.95 a share.</p>
<p>-- shares of Sun were 1/2 higher at 25-3/8 in afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
